# Public settings for the live site, read by `npm run build` (and so by Cloudflare's builds).
# Both values are designed to be public: the publishable key only lets a browser talk to the
# database, and row-level security in supabase/migrations decides what each person can see.
# Never put the secret or service-role key in any VITE_ variable.
